---
import Install from "./Install.astro";
---

<section
  aria-labelledby="hero-title"
  class="shell pt-[clamp(4.5rem,13vh,9.5rem)] pb-[clamp(6rem,16vh,11rem)]"
>
  <h1
    id="hero-title"
    class="rise -ml-[0.035em] text-[clamp(3.25rem,12.4vw,9.5rem)] leading-[0.9] font-medium tracking-[-0.052em] text-balance text-ink"
  >
    Observe
    <br />
    everything AI.
  </h1>

  <p
    class="rise mt-[clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem)] max-w-[34rem] text-[clamp(1.125rem,1.6vw,1.3125rem)] leading-[1.5] text-pretty text-muted"
    style="--i: 1"
  >
    Vario is an open-source command-line tool that collects your AI
    conversations, token usage and execution telemetry into a ClickHouse
    database you control.
  </p>

  <div class="rise mt-[clamp(2.75rem,6vw,4.5rem)] max-w-[61rem]" style="--i: 2">
    <Install />
  </div>
</section>
